---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Datafore Analytics Inc. handles personal information collected through this website."
>
  <section class="border-b border-navy-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 pb-14 pt-16 md:pt-24">
      <h1 class="text-[2.5rem] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-[3.5rem]">Privacy policy.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-graphite-600">Last updated <span class="figures">October 2026</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-14 md:py-20">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-[68ch]">
      <p>
        Datafore Analytics Inc. ("Datafore", "we", "us") is based in Burnaby, British Columbia, Canada. This policy
        covers the personal information we collect through this website. It does not yet cover the Datafore
        platform itself, which is under active development — a dedicated policy will apply once that product is
        available to clinics.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you email us, call us, send a message through our contact form, book a call, or otherwise contact Datafore through this site, we collect the information you
        choose to share — such as your name, contact details, clinic name, and the content of your message.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use this information only to respond to you and to follow up about Datafore's platform, including early
        access. We do not sell personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>Services that carry your message</h2>
      <p>
        Messages sent through the contact form are delivered to our inbox by FormSubmit (formsubmit.co), a form-to-email
        service. If you book a call, the booking is handled by Calendly (calendly.com). Both are third-party services
        that may process information outside Canada, under their own privacy policies. Please don't include patient or
        health information in a message or booking.
      </p>

      <h2>Where it's handled</h2>
      <p>
        Once a message reaches us, we aim to store and process it in Canada, and we handle personal information in line with British
        Columbia's Personal Information Protection Act (PIPA) and the federal Personal Information Protection and
        Electronic Documents Act (PIPEDA).
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy or your information can be sent to
        <a href="mailto:info@datafore.ca">info@datafore.ca</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
